# Secrets — never committed, never leave this machine.
**/credentials/.env
**/credentials/credentials.json
**/*.env
!**/credentials/.env.example

# Python environments and build artefacts
**/.venv/
**/__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo

# Runtime data: per-machine, regenerated, not part of the agent definition
**/app-data/
**/temp/

# Cloud account workspaces: `.cinna/account.json` holds an account token, which is
# why the CLI writes it 0600. TWO patterns, and neither covers the other — a `*`
# segment cannot match an empty one, so `Cloud/*/.cinna/` misses `Cloud/.cinna/`
# (verified with `git check-ignore`). The first line is the older flat workspace,
# the second the per-instance `Cloud/<host>/` layout; both still exist in the
# wild, so both are listed. Do not "simplify" this to one line.
Cloud/.cinna/
Cloud/*/.cinna/

# The kit is re-downloadable from the platform; do not version it here.
.cinna-kit/
# Redundant while the line above stands, and here for the workshop that decides to
# version its kit anyway: this file is a per-machine timestamp, rewritten by every
# `kit.py refresh` run including `--check`, and it is never worth a commit.
.cinna-kit/.last_refresh_check

